---
title: Current Work
layout: base.njk
pageType: current-work
description: "Current paintings by Robert Egert. Oil on canvas and board, 2024-2026."
permalink: /current-work/
hideSidebar: true
ogImage: "/assets/images/small-worlds/17.jpg"
---

<div class="cw-landing">
  <header class="cw-landing__header">
    <h1 class="cw-landing__title">Current Work: Small Worlds, 2024&ndash;2026</h1>
    <p class="cw-landing__inquiry-note">Works available by inquiry</p>
    <p class="cw-landing__gallery-note">Gallery and curatorial inquiries welcome. <a href="/contact/">Contact</a></p>
  </header>

  <div class="cw-landing__grid">
    {%- for artwork in collections.currentWorkArtworks %}
    <a href="/current-work/{{ artwork.slug }}/" class="cw-card">
      <figure class="cw-card__figure">
        {% image artwork.src, artwork.title + ", " + artwork.medium + ", " + artwork.dimensions, "grid", "cw-card__img" %}
      </figure>
      <figcaption class="cw-card__caption">
        <span class="cw-card__title">{{ artwork.title }}</span>
        <span class="cw-card__meta">{{ artwork.medium }}, {{ artwork.dimensions }}</span>
      </figcaption>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
